      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW YARIS (4) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on her slick win the start prior, getting around this track over 390m in 22.15. Can return to winning form here if runs up to time two back. WHODAT JEWEL (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Horsham in a handy 23.32 beating Whoppi Devere. Has won two of two starts from this draw. Leading chance again. SPRING LAVER (7) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (23.91) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Horsham. Well placed here and can atone this time. POP POP BANG (3) cannot be ruled out.",
